This is a debian package of the GNU assembler, linker, and binary 
utilities compiled for cross development for the ARM processor on
uClibc based targets.

It is created from a cvs snapshot downloaded from:

  ftp://ftp.funet.fi/pub/gnu/prep/binutils/


